mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: jake-master-edit\ndescription: \"Edit talking-head and short-form video end to end: cut dead space, ums and retakes, add word-timed captions, dynamic visuals and stop motion, then finish the audio at -14 LUFS and export for Reels, TikTok and Shorts. Combines the HyperFrames, Remotion and video-use editing skills with local ffmpeg tools. Use whenever someone wants to edit, cut, tighten or caption a video, or says \\\"cut the dead space\\\", \\\"remove the silences\\\", \\\"cut the ums\\\", \\\"jump cuts\\\", \\\"add captions\\\" or \\\"subtitles\\\", \\\"make this a reel\\\", \\\"add b-roll\\\" or \\\"motion graphics\\\", \\\"make a stop motion\\\", \\\"fix my audio\\\", or drops raw footage that needs to become postable.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/master-skills\n  upstream_skill: edit\n  upstream_commit: b5b43e44f0a976ad25bda5095a94c161aab2f086\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
